@startuml Code_Heating_Command_Sequence
title Code — Sequence: пользователь включает отопление

actor User as user
participant "Web Frontend" as web
participant "API Gateway" as gw
participant "heating-service" as heat
database "heating-db" as hdb
queue "Message Broker" as broker
participant "device-adapter" as adapter
participant "Устройство отопления" as device
participant "telemetry-service" as tele

user -> web: Нажать «Включить отопление»
web -> gw: POST /api/v1/heating/{deviceId}/on
gw -> heat: REST: TurnHeatingOn

heat -> hdb: Сохранить команду / целевой режим
hdb --> heat: OK
heat -> broker: publish HeatingCommandIssued
heat --> gw: 202 Accepted
gw --> web: Accepted
web --> user: Команда принята

broker -> adapter: HeatingCommandIssued
adapter -> device: Команда ON (MQTT/HTTPS)
device --> adapter: Ack + новый статус
adapter -> broker: publish DeviceStatusChanged
adapter -> broker: publish TelemetryReceived

broker -> heat: DeviceStatusChanged
heat -> hdb: Обновить фактический статус

broker -> tele: TelemetryReceived
tele -> tele: Сохранить измерение

@enduml
